OL,3,GNEWSAMan barricaded in house threatens
OL,4,Ato set it on fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say a man who has barricaded
OL,7,Fhimself in a house for more than 24
OL,8,Fhours is threatening to "set fire to
OL,9,Fit" if anyone enters.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Coast Road,
OL,12,FHopton-on-Sea, near Great Yarmouth,
OL,13,Fshortly after 11:30 GMT on Wednesday,
OL,14,Ffollowing reports a man had made
OL,15,Fthreats when attempts had been made to
OL,16,Fevict him.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
